# Cloudflare Pages routing.
#
# Specific files (portal.html, docs/, openapi.yaml, *.css, etc.) are served
# as-is — Pages tries the literal path first and only falls through to a
# rewrite when the file doesn't exist. The catch-all below maps any
# otherwise-unknown path to /index.html so the Scalar API reference page
# can show a friendly "no such doc" rather than the default 404.
/*  /index.html  200
